WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Jumping medium punch intercepts Blanka’s jump as Counter Hit.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The delayed held air Knuckle catches Blanka after jump medium.

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Medium Rising Uppercut catches Blanka after Luke lands.

4
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.550
Luke lands while Blanka falls toward the ground.

5
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.800
Blanka completes the knockdown away from Luke.
